{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33806","headline":"太湖诗 石板 · 皮日休","name":"太湖诗 石板","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠石数百步，如板漂不流。\n空疑水妃意，浮出青玉洲。\n中若莹龙劒，外唯叠蛇矛。\n狂波忽然死，浩气清且浮。\n似将翠黛色，抹破太湖秋。\n安得三五夕，携酒櫂扁舟。\n召取月夫人，啸歌於上头。\n又恐霄景阔，虚皇拜仙侯。\n欲建九锡碑，当立十二楼。\n琼文忽然下，石板谁能留。\n此事少知者，唯应波上鸥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}